WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:04.870
Dear Fellow Scholars, this is Two Minute Papers
with Károly Zsolnai-Fehér.

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:10.800
We just hit 5000 subscribers. More than five
thousand Fellow Scholars who wish to join

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.000
us on our journey of science. It really shows
that everyone loves science, they just don't

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.810
know about it yet!

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:23.250
About 6 months ago, we were celebrating 250
subscribers. The growth of the channel has

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:28.340
been nothing short of incredible, and this
is all attributed to you. Without you Fellow

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:33.260
Scholars, this series would be nothing but
a crazy person sitting at home, talking into

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.140
a microphone and having way too much fun!
Thank you so much for hanging in there! I

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:43.810
love doing this and am delighted to have each
of you in our growing club of Fellow Scholars!

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:49.890
We have also hit half a million views. Holy
cow! If we would substitute one human being

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:56.180
for every view, we would be close to 6% of
the population of Austria, or almost 30% of

00:00:56.180 --> 00:01:01.350
the population of the beautiful Vienna. This
is equivalent to about 60% of the population

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:02.680
of San Francisco.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:07.900
This is way beyond the amount of people I
could ever reach by teaching at the university.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:12.600
It is a true privilege to teach so many people
from all around the world.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.990
We have so many plans to improve the series
in different directions. We have recently

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:22.570
switched to 60 frames per second for beautiful
smooth, and silky animations, and closed captions

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:27.520
are also now uploaded for most episodes to
improve the clarity of the presentations.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:32.080
We are also looking at adding more Patreon
perks in the future. There are also tons of

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:36.970
amazing research works up the sleeve that
you will see very soon in the upcoming videos.

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:42.540
Graphics guys, I got your back, machine learners,
this way please. Other spicy topics will also

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:48.200
be showcased to keep it fresh and exciting.
My wife Felícia is also preparing some incredible

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.610
artwork for you.

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:53.050
Thanks for watching and for your generous
support, and I'll see you next time!

